"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f931f61d-4047-5139-aa5b-4543e487c8c1" :answer/id #uuid "f931f61d-4047-5139-aa5b-4543e487c8c1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-020499ba-78b6-5552-952e-1513094a7f43" :answer/id #uuid "020499ba-78b6-5552-952e-1513094a7f43" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f8473e0c-62b4-58e6-a483-42bfb6112feb" :answer/id #uuid "f8473e0c-62b4-58e6-a483-42bfb6112feb" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II  only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e8452f70-f910-5391-b495-143107593373" :answer/id #uuid "e8452f70-f910-5391-b495-143107593373" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9fc897fb-074a-54a5-bc11-82ecd98b176c" :answer/id #uuid "9fc897fb-074a-54a5-bc11-82ecd98b176c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-90696491-f11a-5ce4-ba23-2e9e528653c4" :question/id #uuid "90696491-f11a-5ce4-ba23-2e9e528653c4" :question/math-academy-id "q-113396" :question/problem "![](images/41/41d9a3bcc715c0d5db4a910906f471695455065d198d90f3fa6d540e8cdb1c03.png)\n\nFor the diagram shown above, which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. The segments $\\overset{―}{BC}$ and $\\overset{―}{CD}$ are congruent\n\nII. $\\overset{―}{AE}≅\\overset{―}{AB}$\n\nIII. $BD=4\\,\\text{cm}$" :question/worked-solution "- Statement I is false. From the picture, the two segments $\\overset{―}{BC}$ and $\\overset{―}{CD}$ have different hash marks, so \n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{BC}≇\\overset{―}{CD}.\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true. According to the picture, we have that both $\\overset{―}{AE}$ and $\\overset{―}{AB}$ have the same hash marks, so\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{AE}≅\\overset{―}{AB}.\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false. From the picture, the two $\\overset{―}{AB}$ and $\\overset{―}{BD}$ have different hash marks, so \n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{AB}≇\\overset{―}{BD}.\n$$\n\nHence, $AB\\ne BD,$ and since $AB=4\\,\\text{cm},$ we have $BD\\ne 4\\,\\text{cm}.$\n\nTherefore, only statement II is true." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-07dcff8a-6d6f-5747-8d24-af20d21d6344"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-07dcff8a-6d6f-5747-8d24-af20d21d6344" :answer-field/id #uuid "07dcff8a-6d6f-5747-8d24-af20d21d6344" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-7fc4150d-fbd2-53f5-b2fa-3dada3fa54cf" :answer-field/choices ["answer-14f3d1dd-b7aa-5606-92fa-8f606c3c8b23" "answer-3e7b8203-f2ab-52dc-b7ba-9d4290aef807" "answer-3d687982-8928-5334-9445-9070d362aff2" "answer-7fc4150d-fbd2-53f5-b2fa-3dada3fa54cf" "answer-3d450c53-59ff-5e26-a0e6-1963c8cdfb6d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-14f3d1dd-b7aa-5606-92fa-8f606c3c8b23" :answer/id #uuid "14f3d1dd-b7aa-5606-92fa-8f606c3c8b23" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3e7b8203-f2ab-52dc-b7ba-9d4290aef807" :answer/id #uuid "3e7b8203-f2ab-52dc-b7ba-9d4290aef807" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3d687982-8928-5334-9445-9070d362aff2" :answer/id #uuid "3d687982-8928-5334-9445-9070d362aff2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7fc4150d-fbd2-53f5-b2fa-3dada3fa54cf" :answer/id #uuid "7fc4150d-fbd2-53f5-b2fa-3dada3fa54cf" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3d450c53-59ff-5e26-a0e6-1963c8cdfb6d" :answer/id #uuid "3d450c53-59ff-5e26-a0e6-1963c8cdfb6d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-bbeab3a9-f2b6-54a4-9522-21b49d07ec48" :question/id #uuid "bbeab3a9-f2b6-54a4-9522-21b49d07ec48" :question/math-academy-id "q-113405" :question/problem "![](images/a9/a94a13b06d682fe525278b529ed862cbfacecc3a97900ad54a80d66bf4971658.png)\n\nFor the diagram shown above, which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. The segments $\\overset{―}{AB}$ and $\\overset{―}{BC}$ are congruent\n\nII. $\\overset{―}{DB}≅\\overset{―}{CE}$\n\nIII. $AD=2\\,\\text{cm}$" :question/worked-solution "- Statement I is false. From the picture, the two segments $\\overset{―}{AB}$ and $\\overset{―}{BC}$ have different hash marks, so \n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{AB}≇\\overset{―}{BC}.\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false. From the picture, the two segments $\\overset{―}{DB}$ and $\\overset{―}{CE}$ have different hash marks, so \n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{DB}≇\\overset{―}{CE}.\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true. According to the picture, we have that both $\\overset{―}{AD}$ and $\\overset{―}{BC}$ have the same hash marks, so\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{AD}≅\\overset{―}{BC}.\n$$\n\nHence, $AD=BC=2\\,\\text{cm}.$\n\nTherefore, only statement III is true." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-2116cc24-7323-512a-ae0d-02a9716f23ab"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-2116cc24-7323-512a-ae0d-02a9716f23ab" :answer-field/id #uuid "2116cc24-7323-512a-ae0d-02a9716f23ab" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-d01bd079-4f5c-5514-8964-aa8fffcddd2f" :answer-field/choices ["answer-d376981d-dfa3-5241-9f4c-d896f3a735b2" "answer-391d0816-5c4e-597f-9a2b-7df77f7a1c1e" "answer-e53cdf86-8d72-5abb-a4c5-558ca2d86b6d" "answer-76c91554-4c9b-5305-a578-4304308c8366" "answer-d01bd079-4f5c-5514-8964-aa8fffcddd2f"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d376981d-dfa3-5241-9f4c-d896f3a735b2" :answer/id #uuid "d376981d-dfa3-5241-9f4c-d896f3a735b2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-391d0816-5c4e-597f-9a2b-7df77f7a1c1e" :answer/id #uuid "391d0816-5c4e-597f-9a2b-7df77f7a1c1e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e53cdf86-8d72-5abb-a4c5-558ca2d86b6d" :answer/id #uuid "e53cdf86-8d72-5abb-a4c5-558ca2d86b6d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-76c91554-4c9b-5305-a578-4304308c8366" :answer/id #uuid "76c91554-4c9b-5305-a578-4304308c8366" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d01bd079-4f5c-5514-8964-aa8fffcddd2f" :answer/id #uuid "d01bd079-4f5c-5514-8964-aa8fffcddd2f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-51446c30-9b6a-505e-b4e5-79d8ad4dcdb4" :question/id #uuid "51446c30-9b6a-505e-b4e5-79d8ad4dcdb4" :question/math-academy-id "q-113408" :question/problem "![](images/a5/a5373ce6d1ab92c8b71feccf545a79b2515b66198ec4ffb557c9501a171b8021.png)\n\nFor the diagram shown above, which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. The segments $\\overset{―}{BC}$ and $\\overset{―}{CE}$ are congruent\n\nII. $DC=CE$\n\nIII. $BD=3\\,\\text{cm}$" :question/worked-solution "- Statement I is true. According to the picture, we have that both $\\overset{―}{BC}$ and $\\overset{―}{CE}$ have the same double hash marks, so\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{BC}≅\\overset{―}{CE}.\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false. From the picture, the two segments $\\overset{―}{DC}$ and $\\overset{―}{CE}$ have different hash marks, so \n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{DC}≇\\overset{―}{CE}.\n$$\n\nHence, $DC\\ne CE.$\n\n- Statement III is true. According to the picture, we have that $\\overset{―}{BD}$ and $\\overset{―}{AB}$ have the same hash marks, so \n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{BD}≅\\overset{―}{AB}.\n$$\n\nHence, $BD=AB=3\\,\\text{cm}.$\n\nTherefore, only statements I and III are true." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-70f63dd8-03b3-522d-a3a2-f59eedc2c7d0"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-70f63dd8-03b3-522d-a3a2-f59eedc2c7d0" :answer-field/id #uuid "70f63dd8-03b3-522d-a3a2-f59eedc2c7d0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-cb91ead7-c25d-576e-866d-536a9a359a78" :answer-field/choices ["answer-0538352e-c960-5edd-b769-4afa4dadefe2" "answer-cb91ead7-c25d-576e-866d-536a9a359a78" "answer-9a1a2615-71f9-59bf-853a-7afb1994c394" "answer-ba283659-1139-5029-b99b-fe2c124abc2a" "answer-eab6eba6-033b-5909-b595-c87cbe2fed1d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0538352e-c960-5edd-b769-4afa4dadefe2" :answer/id #uuid "0538352e-c960-5edd-b769-4afa4dadefe2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cb91ead7-c25d-576e-866d-536a9a359a78" :answer/id #uuid "cb91ead7-c25d-576e-866d-536a9a359a78" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9a1a2615-71f9-59bf-853a-7afb1994c394" :answer/id #uuid "9a1a2615-71f9-59bf-853a-7afb1994c394" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ba283659-1139-5029-b99b-fe2c124abc2a" :answer/id #uuid "ba283659-1139-5029-b99b-fe2c124abc2a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I, II, and III" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-eab6eba6-033b-5909-b595-c87cbe2fed1d" :answer/id #uuid "eab6eba6-033b-5909-b595-c87cbe2fed1d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-3f0cab83-1e6c-56a1-bd89-cee806fa30d5" :question/id #uuid "3f0cab83-1e6c-56a1-bd89-cee806fa30d5" :question/math-academy-id "q-67597" :question/problem "![](images/7f/7f2467ce2b4c3e1a446b3fb50b88c77ad70db02293f7f8a8f76ba4bd718bebdb.png)\n\nFor the diagram shown above, which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. The segments $\\overset{―}{DB}$ and $\\overset{―}{BE}$ are not congruent\n\nII. $\\overset{―}{AD}≅\\overset{―}{BE}$\n\nIII. $CE\\ne 5\\,\\text{cm}$" :question/worked-solution "- Statement I is false. According to the picture, we have that both $\\overset{―}{DB}$ and $\\overset{―}{BE}$ have the same hash marks, so\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{DB}≅\\overset{―}{BE}.\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false. According to the picture, we have that $\\overset{―}{AD}$ and $\\overset{―}{BE}$ have different hash marks, so\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{AD}≇\\overset{―}{BE}.\n$$\n\n- Statement III is true. According to the picture, we have that $\\overset{―}{BE}$ and $\\overset{―}{CE}$ have different hash marks, so\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{BE}≇\\overset{―}{CE}.\n$$\n\nHence, $BE\\ne CE,$ and since $BE=5\\,\\text{cm}$, we have $CE\\ne 5\\,\\text{cm}.$,\n\nTherefore, only statement III is true." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-6095e7a0-db08-52d4-91d0-ee2e6637d22f"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-6095e7a0-db08-52d4-91d0-ee2e6637d22f" :answer-field/id #uuid "6095e7a0-db08-52d4-91d0-ee2e6637d22f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-abc732d7-d392-5f07-8c26-e740fa66d1e7" :answer-field/choices ["answer-b3c35187-837a-5081-89a9-be725344a90e" "answer-babf8b40-36ce-53b6-922b-79925ab2ab44" "answer-0824ac96-69d8-5ebc-b715-d16735e64e22" "answer-7e0d8977-aa92-5e84-a9ef-b749cedf76b6" "answer-abc732d7-d392-5f07-8c26-e740fa66d1e7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-b3c35187-837a-5081-89a9-be725344a90e" :answer/id #uuid "b3c35187-837a-5081-89a9-be725344a90e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-babf8b40-36ce-53b6-922b-79925ab2ab44" :answer/id #uuid "babf8b40-36ce-53b6-922b-79925ab2ab44" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0824ac96-69d8-5ebc-b715-d16735e64e22" :answer/id #uuid "0824ac96-69d8-5ebc-b715-d16735e64e22" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7e0d8977-aa92-5e84-a9ef-b749cedf76b6" :answer/id #uuid "7e0d8977-aa92-5e84-a9ef-b749cedf76b6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-abc732d7-d392-5f07-8c26-e740fa66d1e7" :answer/id #uuid "abc732d7-d392-5f07-8c26-e740fa66d1e7" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-6bf86eb0-0d69-505c-9f67-1fb5751e701a" :question/id #uuid "6bf86eb0-0d69-505c-9f67-1fb5751e701a" :question/math-academy-id "q-113406" :question/problem "![](images/63/63789e47ee7a429edd48100456e3c8fdb536a1f67542c27ef687e5e85553f899.png)\n\nFor the diagram shown above, which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. The segments $\\overset{―}{AB}$ and $\\overset{―}{AD}$ are congruent\n\nII. $\\overset{―}{AC}≅\\overset{―}{BC}$\n\nIII. $BE\\ne 4\\,\\text{cm}$" :question/worked-solution "- Statement I is true. According to the picture, we have that both $\\overset{―}{AB}$ and $\\overset{―}{AD}$ have the same hash marks, so\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{AB}≅\\overset{―}{AD}.\n$$\n\n- Statement II is true. According to the picture, we have that both $\\overset{―}{AC}$ and $\\overset{―}{BC}$ have the same double hash marks, so\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{AC}≅\\overset{―}{BC}.\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false. From the picture, the two segments $\\overset{―}{AB}$ and $\\overset{―}{BE}$ have the same hash marks, so \n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{AB}≅\\overset{―}{BE}.\n$$\n\nHence, $AB=BE=4\\,\\text{cm}.$\n\nTherefore, only statements I and II are true." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-7f4e1a9b-a9d1-5524-bd07-0fc9b61f95e8"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-7f4e1a9b-a9d1-5524-bd07-0fc9b61f95e8" :answer-field/id #uuid "7f4e1a9b-a9d1-5524-bd07-0fc9b61f95e8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-ee5e6fa3-e724-5eb0-9f5d-1f0fa004c3b5" :answer-field/choices ["answer-ee5e6fa3-e724-5eb0-9f5d-1f0fa004c3b5" "answer-e78b583d-9757-5be5-b19b-add75ac3445d" "answer-95718bfd-f92e-5b92-af62-d2230c2d2b71" "answer-8bbae0e2-1659-50b0-aa2a-1eef7525b6b0" "answer-52e9998d-fbdc-5120-b6ec-5e57464f505c"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-ee5e6fa3-e724-5eb0-9f5d-1f0fa004c3b5" :answer/id #uuid "ee5e6fa3-e724-5eb0-9f5d-1f0fa004c3b5" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-e78b583d-9757-5be5-b19b-add75ac3445d" :answer/id #uuid "e78b583d-9757-5be5-b19b-add75ac3445d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-95718bfd-f92e-5b92-af62-d2230c2d2b71" :answer/id #uuid "95718bfd-f92e-5b92-af62-d2230c2d2b71" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8bbae0e2-1659-50b0-aa2a-1eef7525b6b0" :answer/id #uuid "8bbae0e2-1659-50b0-aa2a-1eef7525b6b0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I, II, and III" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-52e9998d-fbdc-5120-b6ec-5e57464f505c" :answer/id #uuid "52e9998d-fbdc-5120-b6ec-5e57464f505c" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186111834 :tutorial/content "When two line segments have the same length, they are **congruent** segments. To indicate that the line segments $\\overline{AB}$ and $\\overline{CD}$ are congruent we write \n\n$$\n\\overline{AB} \\:\\:{\\color{red}\\boldsymbol{\\cong}}\\:\\: \\overline{CD},\n$$\n\nand we use special marks like in the diagram below.\n\n![](images/6d/6d7fd26fce7dce67fa57769db3e96be503051be5c7d2c7714ed48927547d5165.png)\n\nWe can also write \n\n$$\nAB \\:{\\color{blue}=}\\: CD,\n$$\n\nwhich means that the measure of $\\overline{AB}$ is equal to the measure of $\\overline{CD}.$\n\n**Watch out!** The equation \n\n$$\n\\overline{AB} = \\overline{CD}\n$$\n\nis only true when both $\\overline{AB}$ and $\\overline{CD}$ correspond to the same exact segment. When the segments are distinct, we should use the symbol $\\cong$ to represent that the two segments are separate but that they have the same length." :db/ensure [:tutorial/validate]} {:db/id 17592186110834 :activity/expected-seconds 420.0 :db/ensure [:activity/validate]}]
